#TRACE `Art 31(9) the duty of the notified body to take out liability insurance` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 31 notified body` DOES `Art 31(9) take out appropriate liability insurance for the conformity assessment activities` AT 10
